# Site spec → config

- Schema: `docs/SITE_SPEC.schema.json`. Example: `docs/SITE_SPEC.example.yaml`.
- Apply prompt: `docs/prompts/02-apply-spec.md`.
- `null` / omitted optional blocks = disable feature (do not leave template Acme data enabled).
- Map YAML keys → config files per `docs/AGENT.md`.
- Enable `pages.sections` only when matching copy exists in `content` / related config.
- Resolve `assets[].role` to paths; rasters via `raster.ts`.
- Optional shop: `shop` → `shop.ts`; credentials only via `PUBLIC_SHOPIFY_*` (see `docs/SHOP.md`).
